1
00:02:09,685 --> 00:02:18,955
Visit turkision.com for more!

2
00:02:28,890 --> 00:02:34,361
You'll go and protect the tax
gold we collected for the emperor.

3
00:02:36,831 --> 00:02:41,702
This map shows the areas
that soldiers will camp.

4
00:02:45,006 --> 00:02:48,742
Be quick.
They must have reached Karasu by now.

5
00:02:49,711 --> 00:02:51,945
What about Osman?

6
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:54,481
-What about him, sir?
-Osman...

7
00:02:54,649 --> 00:02:59,920
...is just a wounded prey.
He'll never make it out of this forest.

8
00:03:02,323 --> 00:03:05,459
Hit the road. Go.

9
00:03:31,352 --> 00:03:34,554
While you're supposed to
send your dogs after me,

10
00:03:35,123 --> 00:03:38,258
...where are they going now?

11
00:03:39,460 --> 00:03:42,396
I'll burn this headquarter down over you.

12
00:03:42,897 --> 00:03:48,135
But first I need to find out...

13
00:03:50,705 --> 00:03:55,709
...what this important task is, Constantin.

14
00:04:04,852 --> 00:04:07,621
Husrev.

15
00:04:08,790 --> 00:04:11,058
Husrev?

16
00:04:13,094 --> 00:04:15,195
Husrev.

17
00:04:15,997 --> 00:04:20,801
Husrev. Husrev? What
happened to you? Who did this?

18
00:04:21,135 --> 00:04:23,670
The dog called Kanyumaz.

19
00:04:23,771 --> 00:04:26,673
He's clearly up to something here.

20
00:04:27,875 --> 00:04:31,912
-But I don't know what it is.
-He must have come...

21
00:04:31,979 --> 00:04:35,649
...to tell Constantin that I serve Osman Bey.

22
00:04:37,618 --> 00:04:40,320
What are you talking about, Holofira Hatun?

23
00:04:40,588 --> 00:04:43,890
Constantin got a letter...

24
00:04:44,125 --> 00:04:47,227
...from supposedly Elcim Hatun.

25
00:04:47,795 --> 00:04:51,331
Mehmed Bey is playing a trick against us.

26
00:04:51,833 --> 00:04:55,902
The snake called Andra confessed
everything before she died.

27
00:05:07,115 --> 00:05:11,051
You finally got what you deserved, Snake.

28
00:05:13,521 --> 00:05:16,456
Soldiers!

29
00:05:16,691 --> 00:05:20,227
This traitor has turned out
to be serving Osman Bey.

30
00:05:20,461 --> 00:05:23,230
She tried to kill me.

31
00:05:35,409 --> 00:05:40,247
I'll find a horse for you
to get out of Bursa safely.

32
00:05:40,648 --> 00:05:44,684
-Can you ride to the tribe?
-For sure.

33
00:05:45,052 --> 00:05:48,722
You aren't safe here anymore.

34
00:05:49,157 --> 00:05:51,258
Why don't you come with me?

35
00:05:51,392 --> 00:05:54,027
Don't worry.
I'll be safe here.

36
00:05:54,295 --> 00:05:58,265
Constantin will try to use me before killing me.

37
00:05:58,466 --> 00:06:00,834
Besides, I haven't completed my duty here yet.

38
00:06:01,002 --> 00:06:05,272
I can't go back without punishing the ones
who played a part in my father's murder.

39
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:10,644
We don't have much time.
Come on. Let's get out of here.

40
00:06:22,557 --> 00:06:25,692
That's Osman.

41
00:06:29,797 --> 00:06:32,132
He's found us.

42
00:06:38,573 --> 00:06:43,210
-Osman...
Yes, Osman.

43
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:50,917
-Where are you going, Aleksios?
-This is just a fool's bravery.

44
00:06:50,985 --> 00:06:54,721
You're on your own and wounded.

45
00:06:55,089 --> 00:06:58,291
Wind can only take dust from the rock.

46
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:01,428
Attack!

47
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:30,590
Now you'll speak.
You worked with Ulcay.

48
00:07:30,958 --> 00:07:35,362
You killed Gunduz Bey together. But tell me.

49
00:07:35,897 --> 00:07:39,532
How did you dare to confront me?

50
00:07:40,268 --> 00:07:43,036
I got orders from Constantin and did it.

51
00:07:43,571 --> 00:07:46,506
Just like your alps.

52
00:07:47,642 --> 00:07:51,544
-Spare my life.
-Cut it! Constantin have no power to do that.

53
00:07:51,978 --> 00:07:55,848
Tell me. Who supports you?

54
00:07:56,217 --> 00:08:00,620
Emperor. He knows you want Bursa.

55
00:08:01,188 --> 00:08:04,491
He made an agreement
with Olcaytu to protect Bursa.

56
00:08:05,092 --> 00:08:09,629
You can never achieve! You
can't beat them, Osman Bey.

57
00:08:10,231 --> 00:08:13,033
They are too powerful.

58
00:08:13,334 --> 00:08:15,769
More powerful than Allah's army?

59
00:08:17,605 --> 00:08:19,973
Now it's your turn.

60
00:08:20,141 --> 00:08:23,376
And Olcaytu will be the next.

61
00:08:33,788 --> 00:08:36,589
This note you took from Constantin.

62
00:08:37,058 --> 00:08:40,427
What is in the other locations
apart from Bursa and Yalakova?

63
00:08:40,561 --> 00:08:43,863
-I don't know.
-Don't you know where you were going?

64
00:08:43,998 --> 00:08:47,133
I can skin you alive here.

65
00:08:47,368 --> 00:08:51,004
-Speak!
-Alright. Alright.

66
00:08:51,539 --> 00:08:54,174
We're sending the war taxes to the emperor.

67
00:08:54,241 --> 00:08:58,178
And the emperor will recruit
an army with the gold, huh?

68
00:08:59,113 --> 00:09:04,284
Yes. He'll have an unprecedented army.

69
00:09:05,419 --> 00:09:09,456
-Spare my life.
-You know what?

70
00:09:10,624 --> 00:09:14,427
I can still hear Gunduz Bey's screams.

71
00:09:14,729 --> 00:09:17,230
So...

72
00:09:18,833 --> 00:09:22,369
An eye for an eye.

73
00:09:37,485 --> 00:09:42,288
The day will be over shortly but we
couldn't find any trails from my Bey.

74
00:09:42,390 --> 00:09:44,924
We can't trace in the dark, my Shahzade.

75
00:09:45,159 --> 00:09:48,561
We have to use the daylight as long as we can.

76
00:10:00,741 --> 00:10:04,944
-Trails here!
-Demirboga! Check it out.

77
00:10:15,723 --> 00:10:19,459
The trails belong to Bursa
horses. Also some footprints here.

78
00:10:19,660 --> 00:10:22,729
-It seems they searched here.
-Come on, Cerkutay Bey.

79
00:10:22,863 --> 00:10:25,698
Show your skills.

80
00:10:29,303 --> 00:10:34,674
Lion is wounded but
still alive, thanks to Allah!

81
00:10:41,749 --> 00:10:44,651
Don't be upset, my Shahzade.

82
00:10:45,152 --> 00:10:49,289
Holofira on one hand and my Bey on the other.

83
00:10:49,390 --> 00:10:52,158
How can I be not upset?

84
00:10:54,095 --> 00:10:56,696
My Shahzade, that dog...

85
00:10:56,797 --> 00:11:00,633
...won't kill Holofira Hatun until he's
done with her. He wants to use her.

86
00:11:01,669 --> 00:11:04,904
The dog called Constantin is going to die.

87
00:11:05,739 --> 00:11:08,041
So Holofira will be saved, if Allah permits.

88
00:11:08,142 --> 00:11:09,976
-If Allah permits.
-If Allah permits.

89
00:11:10,077 --> 00:11:13,012
And Elcim Hatun will be acquitted.

90
00:11:17,051 --> 00:11:19,619
My Shahzade.

91
00:11:24,058 --> 00:11:29,129
They got on the horses here and went north.

92
00:11:29,363 --> 00:11:32,532
Alps, come on

93
00:11:39,340 --> 00:11:44,410
Nobody but us knew that
Holofira was a spy in Bursa.

94
00:11:48,649 --> 00:11:51,551
Right?

95
00:11:52,253 --> 00:11:56,389
No, mother. Nobody but us knows this secret.

96
00:11:56,724 --> 00:12:01,661
But Constantin knows.

97
00:12:03,964 --> 00:12:07,534
We'll find out how he learned that.

98
00:12:08,369 --> 00:12:12,405
Someone hostile to us
would only expose this secret.

99
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:16,009
You're right, Gonca. But...

100
00:12:16,277 --> 00:12:20,947
How could they learn
while only we knew about it?

101
00:12:23,384 --> 00:12:28,054
If you talked about it somewhere
someone may have heard.

102
00:12:28,923 --> 00:12:33,626
But you wouldn't talk about
such an important matter in public.

103
00:12:33,827 --> 00:12:35,428
Right?

104
00:12:36,664 --> 00:12:40,500
Holofira is risking her life for Osman Bey.

105
00:12:40,834 --> 00:12:43,570
She's a spy in Bursa.

106
00:12:46,040 --> 00:12:50,910
No, mother. Even I wouldn't mention it anywhere.

107
00:12:51,679 --> 00:12:55,848
This secret didn't put only
Holofira but also my father in danger.

108
00:12:56,483 --> 00:13:00,954
Only someone hostile to us would do this.

109
00:13:03,224 --> 00:13:05,558
You mean my brother?

110
00:13:07,795 --> 00:13:10,530
How could he know, Alaaddin?

111
00:13:13,601 --> 00:13:17,403
Alaaddin, we can't be sure about anything.

112
00:13:18,739 --> 00:13:22,875
There is nobody but Mehmed
who would expose this secret.

113
00:13:23,210 --> 00:13:25,912
-But he doesn't know.
-What if he found out?

114
00:13:26,013 --> 00:13:29,015
How could he have learned it?

115
00:13:30,918 --> 00:13:33,152
I...

116
00:13:35,723 --> 00:13:38,358
...might have done this.

117
00:13:46,218 --> 00:13:50,518
Near Constantin Headquarters

118
00:14:05,419 --> 00:14:07,987
Who are you?

119
00:14:15,362 --> 00:14:18,765
Ulgen is right. When Gonca fell sick..

120
00:14:19,033 --> 00:14:23,703
-..we talked about Holofira issue.
-However, there was no one around.

121
00:14:24,004 --> 00:14:26,072
How can you do such a mistake?

122
00:14:26,106 --> 00:14:28,941
-Elcim?
-We were not paying attention, Bala Hatun.

123
00:14:29,043 --> 00:14:31,511
-We made a mistake.
-That day..

124
00:14:31,612 --> 00:14:34,947
..Mehmed came right after you.

125
00:14:37,284 --> 00:14:41,387
Alaeddin? Are you sure?

126
00:14:41,455 --> 00:14:44,791
I remember.
How can I forget that day.

127
00:14:45,092 --> 00:14:49,729
He acted soft as well.

128
00:14:50,397 --> 00:14:54,600
You were there too, mother. I am telling you..

129
00:14:54,668 --> 00:14:56,069
..Mehmed did it.

130
00:14:56,804 --> 00:15:02,275
-However, we can not be sure.
-Yes, we can not.

131
00:15:03,310 --> 00:15:06,079
How will we find out?

132
00:15:06,213 --> 00:15:09,849
If he has the heart, he
will tell the truth to my face.

133
00:15:10,084 --> 00:15:12,885
-Alaeddin?
-Alaeddin, stop.

134
00:15:12,986 --> 00:15:16,055
Evil in the day is better than
goodness in the night, son.

135
00:15:16,123 --> 00:15:18,291
He threatened my father's life, mother.

136
00:15:18,359 --> 00:15:22,028
-Will he get away with that?
-Alaeddin.

137
00:15:24,131 --> 00:15:28,501
Even if my brother did
this he will not tell you.

138
00:15:28,569 --> 00:15:31,304
I know how to make him talk.

139
00:15:31,505 --> 00:15:34,640
My son. Now is not the time.

140
00:15:34,842 --> 00:15:39,612
Not the time, wait for morning at least. He
is still at Frontier Marketplace anyways.

141
00:15:47,221 --> 00:15:49,989
Hasan!

142
00:15:51,024 --> 00:15:54,260
My Shahzade.

143
00:15:54,361 --> 00:15:56,329
Have them watch Mehmed.

144
00:15:56,430 --> 00:15:58,831
If he leaves Frontier Marketplace..

145
00:15:58,966 --> 00:16:01,734
..catch him and put him in the caged tent.

146
00:16:02,503 --> 00:16:07,407
-Inform me as well.
-As you command, my Shahzade.

147
00:16:15,883 --> 00:16:19,752
I want to say that Grand Emperor..

148
00:16:21,188 --> 00:16:23,823
..I've defeated Osman..

149
00:16:23,957 --> 00:16:26,691
..who has defeated many Lords..

150
00:16:26,759 --> 00:16:31,364
..many commanders.

151
00:16:31,465 --> 00:16:34,767
I am honored to tell you that I took Gunduz..

152
00:16:34,868 --> 00:16:38,070
..and his trusted Beys..

153
00:16:38,171 --> 00:16:41,574
.and Osman is looking for a place to escape.

154
00:16:42,176 --> 00:16:46,312
Now it is time to eradicate all Turks.

155
00:17:00,561 --> 00:17:05,198
The taxes I've collected is on its way.

156
00:17:05,398 --> 00:17:09,535
It will be loaded into ships
and reach Constantinople.

157
00:17:09,636 --> 00:17:13,839
Then, you will assemble a..

158
00:17:13,906 --> 00:17:17,477
..grand army for me to eradicate Turks.

159
00:17:19,079 --> 00:17:22,949
I will kill them in their sleep.

160
00:18:30,884 --> 00:18:34,420
What happened to the guard?

161
00:19:02,249 --> 00:19:05,051
Holofira is at Bursa as well.

162
00:19:09,923 --> 00:19:13,626
What if she is, Elcim?

163
00:19:13,760 --> 00:19:18,531
Don't you know we are going to Bursa for duty?

164
00:19:19,099 --> 00:19:21,100
To keep the promise I've given you..

165
00:19:21,234 --> 00:19:25,071
..and ease the pain in
your heart, even a little bit.

166
00:19:25,906 --> 00:19:27,873
Do not ever..

167
00:19:28,008 --> 00:19:32,244
..question my loyalty. Ever.

168
00:19:35,549 --> 00:19:37,383
My Allah..

169
00:19:37,551 --> 00:19:41,253
..free me from this trouble.

170
00:19:41,355 --> 00:19:45,458
My Shahzade's troubles are very
big. Storms going on inside him.

171
00:19:45,459 --> 00:19:49,095
He couldn't have predicted Elcim
Hatun doing something like this.

172
00:19:49,229 --> 00:19:53,399
You are right, Cerkutay.
Elcim Hatun is of Kayi heritage.

173
00:19:53,400 --> 00:19:56,168
She knows traditions. She
wouldn't do such a mistake.

174
00:19:56,203 --> 00:20:00,139
Someone who knew what is happening
between Elcim Hatun and him did this.

175
00:20:00,207 --> 00:20:03,943
It is dark as well. No sign of my Bey.

176
00:20:04,244 --> 00:20:08,914
What is he doing, how is
he, we don't know anything.

177
00:20:08,982 --> 00:20:13,619
My Bey is like a mountain. He
got the smell of Konstantin it seems.

178
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:16,522
It seems he won't be back before beheading him.

179
00:20:16,757 --> 00:20:19,558
-He is wounded, Boran.
-So, brother?

180
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:21,627
His wound gives him strength.

181
00:20:21,695 --> 00:20:24,130
A valiant wanders around with a bandage.

182
00:20:24,331 --> 00:20:26,098
He is alone against a whole army.

183
00:20:26,199 --> 00:20:28,934
May Allah allows us to
find him without any trouble.

184
00:20:28,935 --> 00:20:31,604
Everyone can go to the war with alps.

185
00:20:31,838 --> 00:20:34,740
The real bravery is going alone.

186
00:20:34,875 --> 00:20:37,109
That is what it means to be Osman Bey.

187
00:20:37,210 --> 00:20:41,814
We will have some infidels too right?

188
00:20:43,116 --> 00:20:47,586
Ten thousand soldiers will walk from the west.

189
00:20:48,088 --> 00:20:51,957
They will take Lefke and Bilecik from them.

190
00:20:52,359 --> 00:20:56,295
Fifteen thousand soldiers from south.

191
00:20:56,430 --> 00:20:58,864
They will take Kestel and Inegol..

192
00:20:59,132 --> 00:21:03,469
..from their hands first.
Then, the armies will merge.

193
00:21:03,670 --> 00:21:07,740
They will eradicate all tribes..

194
00:21:08,041 --> 00:21:11,510
..and Yenisehir, as well as all Turks.

195
00:21:11,878 --> 00:21:15,514
You won't escape from me, Osman.

196
00:21:20,020 --> 00:21:23,522
You both will destroy them..

197
00:21:23,757 --> 00:21:27,326
..and also tell them the
location of the war, is that so?

198
00:21:36,970 --> 00:21:41,006
-Osman is here!
-Osman?

199
00:21:42,209 --> 00:21:44,710
Alone?

200
00:21:50,917 --> 00:21:55,287
You came for your death, Osman.

201
00:21:56,690 --> 00:22:00,493
Are you running away, Osman?

202
00:22:12,139 --> 00:22:15,608
-What is this explosion?
-It seems my father found their location.

203
00:22:15,709 --> 00:22:16,809
Come on, alps!

204
00:22:31,491 --> 00:22:33,659
I will be back Osman!

205
00:22:46,239 --> 00:22:50,242
Of course you run. Go ahead.

206
00:22:59,152 --> 00:23:03,622
I know where you are going.

207
00:23:05,792 --> 00:23:08,627
However, you won't escape from me.

208
00:23:10,797 --> 00:23:13,866
Iltutan!

209
00:23:36,857 --> 00:23:40,459
Many tribes who are left in the darkness..

210
00:23:40,560 --> 00:23:45,931
..saw Osman as salvation and followed him.

211
00:23:46,466 --> 00:23:50,369
They even reached to Yalikova borders.

212
00:23:50,704 --> 00:23:52,805
However..

213
00:23:53,607 --> 00:23:57,843
..soon they will see that they are wrong.

214
00:23:58,178 --> 00:24:03,449
They already did, father.
No one knows if Osman is alive or not.

215
00:24:03,984 --> 00:24:08,954
-They are scared.
-Good.

216
00:24:10,123 --> 00:24:16,095
Germiyanids will relieve them, Mehmed.

217
00:24:17,931 --> 00:24:21,800
The tribes who stand with Osman..

218
00:24:21,935 --> 00:24:26,038
..all of them will see.

219
00:24:26,606 --> 00:24:29,308
How will we do that father?

220
00:24:29,542 --> 00:24:32,177
Osman is alone.

221
00:24:32,445 --> 00:24:36,682
There is no way for him
to get out of this trouble.

222
00:24:37,017 --> 00:24:40,753
Let him get what he deserves first..

223
00:24:41,121 --> 00:24:43,989
..you will see after.

224
00:24:44,324 --> 00:24:47,426
You keep your eyes on Kayis.

225
00:24:47,694 --> 00:24:52,431
-Are we allowed, my Bey?
-Come in, Kanyumaz.

226
00:24:55,635 --> 00:24:57,725
Any news from Osman?

227
00:24:57,737 --> 00:25:00,739
He is still missing, my Bey.

228
00:25:05,145 --> 00:25:09,048
If you get into matters
that are bigger than you..

229
00:25:09,149 --> 00:25:12,751
..you are bound to drown, they say.

230
00:25:13,286 --> 00:25:15,436
He is in a tough situation.

231
00:25:15,448 --> 00:25:17,456
One other thing, my Bey.

232
00:25:20,260 --> 00:25:23,929
What is it, Kanyumaz?

233
00:25:28,368 --> 00:25:30,736
Karesi Bey.

234
00:25:30,837 --> 00:25:34,506
He is still with Osman Bey.

235
00:25:36,643 --> 00:25:39,611
They say he even saved him from the ambush.

236
00:25:40,547 --> 00:25:43,882
So he is still with Osman.

237
00:25:45,485 --> 00:25:48,354
Since you insist on your mistake..

238
00:25:49,456 --> 00:25:53,559
..then you will be..

239
00:25:53,793 --> 00:25:57,262
..history like Osman, Karesi Bey.

240
00:25:57,831 --> 00:26:01,400
Karesi Bey followed Osman..

241
00:26:01,601 --> 00:26:05,104
..and stood against Germiyanids.

242
00:26:05,372 --> 00:26:09,041
Tomorrow, I will go to Kutahya.

243
00:26:09,542 --> 00:26:15,214
Both Osman and Karesi Bey will pay for this.

244
00:26:15,749 --> 00:26:20,486
You will also finish your
duties and come by my side.

245
00:26:21,821 --> 00:26:26,091
However, you will learn..

246
00:26:26,559 --> 00:26:30,329
..what happened to Osman first.

247
00:26:31,431 --> 00:26:35,401
If Osman is dead, he is saved.

248
00:26:37,037 --> 00:26:41,607
If he is alive..

249
00:26:42,442 --> 00:26:45,177
..the things I will do to him..

250
00:26:46,012 --> 00:26:49,048
..will be worse than death.

251
00:27:26,252 --> 00:27:30,722
So you are on your way to get the gold, huh?

252
00:27:30,924 --> 00:27:33,759
I will show you. Come on!

253
00:27:51,344 --> 00:27:55,380
Husrev!
-My Allah!

254
00:27:57,517 --> 00:28:01,320
Come here.
Come here.

255
00:28:06,192 --> 00:28:10,996
Are you alright?
Bring some water! Come on!

256
00:28:23,610 --> 00:28:25,944
Alright, Husrev.

257
00:28:27,046 --> 00:28:30,516
They found out that he was a spy. Is he alright?

258
00:28:36,523 --> 00:28:39,391
They don't believe Holofira.

259
00:28:39,659 --> 00:28:43,695
They say Elcim Hatun... Elcim Hatun did this...

260
00:28:44,864 --> 00:28:48,167
They played a game against her.

261
00:28:51,070 --> 00:28:54,840
So that this game was exposed,
why didn't Holofira come here?

262
00:28:54,941 --> 00:28:58,177
Constantine is her cousin...

263
00:29:00,980 --> 00:29:05,884
He wants to use Holofira to catch Osman Bey.

264
00:29:11,958 --> 00:29:16,195
May Allah help her. Husrev...

265
00:29:16,429 --> 00:29:20,032
Could you find the traitor? Who is it?

266
00:29:21,034 --> 00:29:22,968
Tell us.

267
00:29:27,273 --> 00:29:30,008
Kanyumaz...

268
00:29:31,911 --> 00:29:36,415
Mehmed sent him to Bursa.

269
00:29:43,756 --> 00:29:49,728
Mehmed... I knew it! I knew he
would make a treacherous move!

270
00:29:51,264 --> 00:29:54,600
Alps! Take him to the healing tent!

271
00:29:55,101 --> 00:29:56,835
Come on..

272
00:29:57,604 --> 00:30:00,706
What did you do, brother?

273
00:30:00,707 --> 00:30:03,022
I will not let you get
away with this, Mehmed!

274
00:30:03,034 --> 00:30:03,809
Alaeddin!

275
00:30:03,943 --> 00:30:05,043
Let me go! -Stop...
How can I stop, mother?!

276
00:30:05,044 --> 00:30:07,012
Let me go! -Stop...
-How can I stop, mother?!

277
00:30:07,146 --> 00:30:09,581
We trusted him, but he
lured us into a trap, huh?

278
00:30:09,582 --> 00:30:12,384
But now it's over! It's over!

279
00:30:12,952 --> 00:30:17,422
Mother... mother... If Alaeddin goes there
with this furor, he will kill my brother!

280
00:30:17,457 --> 00:30:20,492
My Allah, protect him!

281
00:30:20,727 --> 00:30:24,963
Hasan... Prepare the Alps. You will
go after Alaeddin once he leaves. Go.

282
00:30:25,031 --> 00:30:28,033
Yes Bala Hatun.

283
00:30:36,309 --> 00:30:40,112
Alaeddin! Alaeddin!
Alaeddin! Stop!

284
00:30:40,146 --> 00:30:43,615
Don't go like this! Please!
Just wait for a moment! -My Gonca...

285
00:30:43,850 --> 00:30:47,853
Don't, my rose! Don't stand in
my way! You cannot do this now.

286
00:30:47,854 --> 00:30:51,723
Alaeddin, I am not asking you to stay.
I swear. But just don't go with this furor.

287
00:30:51,891 --> 00:30:53,959
Wait for a moment. Look...

288
00:30:54,060 --> 00:30:58,130
Terrible things will happen if you go
there with this anger. Stop Alaeddin!

289
00:30:58,131 --> 00:31:01,800
My father, my brother,
Holofira.. They are all in danger!

290
00:31:01,901 --> 00:31:05,871
Because of whom? Because of
Mehmed who was blinded by his anger!

291
00:31:06,539 --> 00:31:09,408
But I know how to open those blind eyes.

292
00:31:09,575 --> 00:31:14,046
Come on! -Alaeddin! Alaeddin!

293
00:31:21,554 --> 00:31:25,457
My Allah, protect my baby!

294
00:31:32,799 --> 00:31:37,002
In the name of Allah... Come on!

295
00:31:41,574 --> 00:31:44,376
Come on!

296
00:32:00,193 --> 00:32:06,465
Come on! Come on!

297
00:32:07,333 --> 00:32:12,471
Come on! Come on!

298
00:32:15,308 --> 00:32:18,910
Come on! Come on!

299
00:32:19,078 --> 00:32:21,213
Damn horse..

300
00:32:32,392 --> 00:32:37,129
I am almost there... Hang on, Constantine.

301
00:32:38,698 --> 00:32:42,100
You will live for your revenge.

302
00:33:02,121 --> 00:33:05,223
Look at this horse...

303
00:33:06,659 --> 00:33:11,329
Look at this horse..

304
00:33:11,397 --> 00:33:14,866
You see, right? There is no
other horse like you, Iltutan!

305
00:33:15,067 --> 00:33:17,936
You have no rivals.
You have no rivals.

306
00:33:18,671 --> 00:33:21,773
Constantine... Where are you going to go?

307
00:33:22,008 --> 00:33:24,409
Now your end has come.

308
00:33:24,977 --> 00:33:30,215
So you went this way. Let's go!

309
00:33:53,905 --> 00:33:56,374
What happened here?

310
00:33:58,110 --> 00:34:00,612
A fire must have broke out.

311
00:34:00,746 --> 00:34:04,416
Apparently they have seen hell before dying.

312
00:34:04,416 --> 00:34:07,586
It seems as if a Gokboru and its
pack have come here, brothers.

313
00:34:07,587 --> 00:34:11,255
The only pack and Gokboru is my father.

314
00:34:11,757 --> 00:34:16,127
Osman Bey has dived into
the midst of the infidels alone.

315
00:34:16,429 --> 00:34:20,866
Allah Allah! IIIAIIah!

316
00:34:21,100 --> 00:34:24,168
Not only did my Bey enter the infidels' nest...

317
00:34:24,270 --> 00:34:29,241
...but he also cut them into pieces.

318
00:34:29,976 --> 00:34:32,710
Alps! We will search everywhere!

319
00:34:32,911 --> 00:34:38,617
We will try to find Osman Bey's tracks! Come on!

320
00:34:41,320 --> 00:34:45,590
Orhan Bey! There is a letter here!

321
00:35:00,606 --> 00:35:02,007
Kayi dagger...

322
00:35:03,476 --> 00:35:07,112
My father left this. He
wanted to show us the way.

323
00:35:07,179 --> 00:35:09,714
He wants us to go after him.

324
00:35:11,350 --> 00:35:16,054
The places between Yalikova
and Bursa are marked, my Bey.

325
00:35:16,255 --> 00:35:19,524
Everyone died. Constantine's
dead body is not around.

326
00:35:20,092 --> 00:35:24,896
So that dog is still alive.

327
00:35:35,908 --> 00:35:39,044
There are tracks!

328
00:35:50,356 --> 00:35:54,259
Orhan Bey... It leads to north.

329
00:35:54,493 --> 00:35:58,630
Dog Constantine is still
alive. My Bey is after him.

330
00:35:59,332 --> 00:36:02,067
The route we will follow is on the paper!

331
00:36:02,335 --> 00:36:07,105
Inform Karesi Bey and Alps! Come on, Alps!

332
00:36:20,386 --> 00:36:22,988
Where are you running, Constantine?

333
00:36:26,392 --> 00:36:30,028
I told you that the truth
was at the tip of my sword.

334
00:36:30,463 --> 00:36:32,820
Now you will meet the truth.

335
00:36:32,832 --> 00:36:35,200
I couldn't have found a...

336
00:36:35,501 --> 00:36:39,371
...more beautiful place to kill you, Osman.

337
00:36:41,240 --> 00:36:44,409
Let's see. Let's see.

338
00:37:24,984 --> 00:37:30,522
So you are running away, huh? So
you are running away, Constantine.

339
00:37:31,924 --> 00:37:35,083
Run away then. Run away.

340
00:37:35,613 --> 00:37:39,976
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

341
00:37:50,843 --> 00:37:55,880
-Both Mehmed and Kanyumaz are
at the marketplace, my Shahzade.

342
00:37:57,049 --> 00:38:00,752
Be careful. Don't let them escape.

343
00:38:04,890 --> 00:38:08,593
Come on. Come on!

344
00:38:17,737 --> 00:38:21,539
Mehmet! Where are you Mehmet?

345
00:38:21,741 --> 00:38:24,676
Come here! Mehmet!

346
00:38:24,777 --> 00:38:27,245
Mehmet, come here!

347
00:38:31,150 --> 00:38:36,321
Kanyumaz... You traitor dog..

348
00:38:38,157 --> 00:38:42,527
Come here... Come here..

349
00:38:45,431 --> 00:38:48,767
You traitor dog... Do you think
you can run away from me, huh?

350
00:38:48,934 --> 00:38:52,170
I am innocent! VAIIahi I am innocent!

351
00:39:32,144 --> 00:39:36,080
-Alaeddin!
You are a sold dog...

352
00:39:39,752 --> 00:39:42,887
Forgive me Alaeddin Bey! Forgive me!

353
00:39:43,088 --> 00:39:45,089
I am innocent!

354
00:39:45,191 --> 00:39:47,892
You wanted to spread evilness in my tribe, huh?

355
00:39:52,498 --> 00:39:56,935
You tried to kill my father!
-Alaeddin!

356
00:39:59,471 --> 00:40:04,042
You worked with infidels, huh?

357
00:40:08,714 --> 00:40:12,851
Stand up! You will tell me everything! Stand up!

358
00:40:14,253 --> 00:40:18,323
Alaeddin!
-You will tell me everything!

359
00:40:22,761 --> 00:40:25,830
Alaeddin...

360
00:40:26,131 --> 00:40:28,700
Now it is time to leave Gokmen.

361
00:40:28,901 --> 00:40:32,604
Prepare our horses.
-Yes my Shahzade.

362
00:40:34,473 --> 00:40:39,010
Speak! Speak! Where is Mehmed?
Where is the man who holds your leash?

363
00:40:39,612 --> 00:40:42,447
I don't know!
-You don't know, huh?

364
00:40:42,514 --> 00:40:46,517
You don't know...
You don't know.

365
00:40:46,619 --> 00:40:49,087
Tell me! Tell me! Who gave that letter to you?

366
00:40:49,154 --> 00:40:53,958
Who informed you? Tell
me! Or I will kill you here!

367
00:40:54,260 --> 00:40:58,630
I just... I just obeyed the orders.

368
00:40:59,431 --> 00:41:01,799
Mehmed Bey gave me the letter.

369
00:41:02,067 --> 00:41:04,936
And I took it to Constantine.

370
00:41:05,137 --> 00:41:08,506
I have no other guilt!

371
00:41:12,044 --> 00:41:17,115
That was not your only
mistake. You betrayed us twice.

372
00:41:28,761 --> 00:41:35,400
Take this dog away! I still have
things to do with him! Take him!

373
00:41:45,511 --> 00:41:48,579
Gonca... Why did you come here?

374
00:41:48,681 --> 00:41:51,416
Why, Alaeddin?

375
00:41:54,253 --> 00:41:58,589
My Shahzade... Mehmed Bey is running away.

376
00:42:05,631 --> 00:42:08,366
Mehmet!

377
00:42:13,539 --> 00:42:17,342
Where will you go, huh? Where will you go?
-Alaeddin!

378
00:42:18,610 --> 00:42:21,946
My father, my brother,
Holofira... He tried to kill them all.

379
00:42:22,281 --> 00:42:25,750
He will pay for this, Gonca.

380
00:42:26,285 --> 00:42:30,922
Mehmet!
-My Allah, let me be strong.

381
00:42:37,162 --> 00:42:42,433
Come on! -Come on!

382
00:43:02,054 --> 00:43:05,456
You went after a prey bigger than your throat.

383
00:43:05,791 --> 00:43:09,027
Now you will lose your life.

384
00:43:09,862 --> 00:43:13,865
Our prey is always big. But...

385
00:43:14,266 --> 00:43:18,770
...we never hunt alone. We never eat alone.

386
00:43:18,937 --> 00:43:22,774
We don't do anything for ourselves.
-Samil!

387
00:43:22,975 --> 00:43:28,179
We do everything for our
tribe and for our people.

388
00:43:28,680 --> 00:43:33,184
What about you?

389
00:43:36,355 --> 00:43:40,291
Don't worry... I will
not eat you alone.

390
00:43:40,492 --> 00:43:46,064
If you finished your sentence, I
am ending your story here, Osman.

391
00:43:48,367 --> 00:43:51,869
As the headquarters burnt...

392
00:43:51,970 --> 00:43:57,642
...wolves saw the fire. My story has just begun.

393
00:44:11,123 --> 00:44:14,258
We've arrived, my Bey!

394
00:44:14,860 --> 00:44:16,994
Constantine..

395
00:44:26,939 --> 00:44:32,009
Good... Your son has come.

396
00:44:32,311 --> 00:44:37,048
Now I will enjoy killing you here.

397
00:44:37,382 --> 00:44:42,120
Constantine... We have..

398
00:44:43,255 --> 00:44:45,056
...just as many men behind you

399
00:44:45,824 --> 00:44:47,191
Shamil!

400
00:44:56,935 --> 00:45:01,172
This battlefield won't be a grave
for Turks but you, Constantin.

401
00:45:01,173 --> 00:45:03,941
Osman Bey's wolves arrived in time to fight.

402
00:45:10,949 --> 00:45:12,216
Alps!

403
00:45:13,218 --> 00:45:14,986
Attack!

404
00:46:03,702 --> 00:46:06,804
Come here, you heathen kind!

405
00:46:07,172 --> 00:46:09,173
You will get your share...

406
00:46:09,374 --> 00:46:12,143
...from Solgur Agha's wrath today.

407
00:46:18,150 --> 00:46:21,285
This is our land out battlefield.

408
00:46:21,420 --> 00:46:24,889
You will only get death today.

409
00:47:24,082 --> 00:47:28,019
Today, you're going to die!

410
00:47:39,164 --> 00:47:41,699
Look at me.

411
00:47:44,403 --> 00:47:47,071
You... Stand up.

412
00:47:47,572 --> 00:47:50,941
You brought the trouble to my land.

413
00:47:51,376 --> 00:47:52,710
Get up!

414
00:47:52,711 --> 00:47:56,480
You killed Gunduz Bey who I called brother.

415
00:47:57,683 --> 00:48:01,319
Get up! Up! You killed my alps.

416
00:48:01,353 --> 00:48:04,522
They became martyrs because of you.

417
00:48:06,625 --> 00:48:09,760
Just wait. Wait.

418
00:48:10,529 --> 00:48:15,900
In these lands, justice can
only be served under my flag.

419
00:48:16,401 --> 00:48:20,271
I provide justice! Here...

420
00:48:20,706 --> 00:48:24,642
The warriors you see here
are fighting all around...

421
00:48:24,910 --> 00:48:28,145
...to provide justice!

422
00:48:30,115 --> 00:48:35,619
And you've been waiting to
die under my sword for long.

423
00:48:36,288 --> 00:48:39,023
This is the time.

424
00:48:43,028 --> 00:48:44,962
You dog!

425
00:48:45,230 --> 00:48:49,900
-You can't even take your life anymore.
-Get your head up.

426
00:48:50,669 --> 00:48:53,170
Get your head up.

427
00:48:54,906 --> 00:48:57,541
I'll kill you.

428
00:48:58,310 --> 00:49:01,011
And you will tell...

429
00:49:01,313 --> 00:49:03,681
...your people in hell...

430
00:49:04,249 --> 00:49:07,351
...that you couldn't beat Osman Bey yet.

431
00:49:32,811 --> 00:49:36,680
I have avenged our brothers and kept my promise!

432
00:49:36,681 --> 00:49:42,620
-Thank Allah!
Thank Allah!

433
00:49:50,328 --> 00:49:55,366
Why did you attempt to do such
a thing on your own, Osman Bey?

434
00:49:55,767 --> 00:50:00,371
I knew you'd arrive in time. Thank you.

435
00:50:03,208 --> 00:50:07,912
Samil arrived just in time,
my Bey. He made us stronger.

436
00:50:08,947 --> 00:50:11,749
Well... If we had attacked all together,

437
00:50:11,783 --> 00:50:14,919
...they might have had a
chance to take the gold away.

438
00:50:15,053 --> 00:50:18,522
But now all our people will share the booty!

439
00:50:18,590 --> 00:50:23,127
If the gold coins had arrived in Constantinople
they'd come back as swords against us.

440
00:50:23,295 --> 00:50:26,931
Exactly. Exactly.

441
00:50:36,475 --> 00:50:39,799
Will the gold fit into our
treasure room, my Bey?

442
00:50:39,811 --> 00:50:40,945
Well,brother...

443
00:50:40,979 --> 00:50:45,449
Have you ever seen Osman Bey
put the booty into the treasure room?

444
00:50:47,919 --> 00:50:51,099
Can we finish this booty
by handing out, my Bey?

445
00:50:51,111 --> 00:50:53,090
We will hand it out. We will.

446
00:50:53,592 --> 00:50:58,028
These gold coins will
strengthen our nation and state.

447
00:50:58,363 --> 00:51:02,933
These are the coins that were
taken from Bursa people by force.

448
00:51:03,568 --> 00:51:07,071
We'll use the gold to save
them from the oppression.

449
00:51:07,072 --> 00:51:09,740
People didn't only get
oppressed in Bursa, my Bey.

450
00:51:09,841 --> 00:51:13,210
But some caused unrest and
Holofira got exposed as well.

451
00:51:13,378 --> 00:51:16,780
And they made it look like Elcim Hatun did it.

452
00:51:16,982 --> 00:51:19,383
Here, my Bey.

453
00:51:20,752 --> 00:51:24,522
-Take this.
-Thank you, thank you, son.

454
00:51:24,689 --> 00:51:26,457
Thank you.

455
00:51:26,591 --> 00:51:30,461
But Elcim would never do this.

456
00:51:30,896 --> 00:51:36,133
As long as this dog lies down
here, Holofira will be at ease.

457
00:51:36,935 --> 00:51:40,204
We've completely settled the matter.

458
00:51:40,372 --> 00:51:44,074
Thank you, my Bey... Well...

459
00:51:45,610 --> 00:51:49,446
I'll go to Bursa and take
Holofira if you let me.

460
00:51:49,548 --> 00:51:53,851
She isn't safe there anymore.
-Well...

461
00:51:55,120 --> 00:51:59,990
Don't act carelessly just
because we cut off this dog's head.

462
00:52:00,325 --> 00:52:02,726
As you order, my Bey.

463
00:52:03,395 --> 00:52:06,897
Solgur Agha, go ahead to the tribe.

464
00:52:06,965 --> 00:52:08,933
We'll come later with the gold.

465
00:52:08,967 --> 00:52:13,270
-Tell alps to escort us on the way.
-As you order, my Bey.

466
00:52:13,538 --> 00:52:16,373
I'll protect you at the cost of my life.

467
00:52:16,441 --> 00:52:18,609
Thank you.

468
00:52:22,981 --> 00:52:25,649
-Samil.
-My Bey.

469
00:52:26,251 --> 00:52:29,553
Well done. Thank you.

470
00:52:32,591 --> 00:52:36,393
Thank you. You and your
warriors did a great job.

471
00:52:36,428 --> 00:52:39,463
You proved yourselves.

472
00:52:39,798 --> 00:52:43,300
You and your warriors will
watch the western borders.

473
00:52:43,468 --> 00:52:45,536
This is your new duty.

474
00:52:45,604 --> 00:52:48,439
Thank you, my Bey. I won't disappoint you.

475
00:52:48,673 --> 00:52:51,675
My Bey, what about these dead bodies?

476
00:52:52,010 --> 00:52:55,846
Samil and his alps will take them away.

477
00:52:56,181 --> 00:52:59,116
They'll be eaten by the animals.

478
00:52:59,684 --> 00:53:03,721
-Come on, alps. Come on.
-As you order, my Bey.

479
00:53:08,193 --> 00:53:12,162
Here we go, alps! Our
Bey trust us for the borders!

480
00:53:12,230 --> 00:53:16,233
It's an honor to protect the border.
It's more important than our lives.

481
00:53:16,568 --> 00:53:20,104
-May Allah help us! -Aameen.

482
00:53:49,601 --> 00:53:53,170
Brother! Brother!

483
00:53:56,441 --> 00:53:59,109
Brother! Brother?

484
00:53:59,310 --> 00:54:01,912
Brother, brother!

485
00:54:02,347 --> 00:54:05,549
Brother! Brother!

486
00:54:11,389 --> 00:54:13,757
-Gokmen?
-Gokmen?

487
00:54:15,360 --> 00:54:17,828
Alaaddin!

488
00:54:20,298 --> 00:54:22,966
Alaaddin...

489
00:54:24,169 --> 00:54:27,404
Mehmed, Mehmed...
-Alaaddin.

490
00:54:27,539 --> 00:54:30,040
You never fight bravely, do you?

491
00:54:30,475 --> 00:54:33,711
You either run off or beat
people by tying them up.

492
00:54:33,912 --> 00:54:37,981
You can't teach me how to be brave, coward.

493
00:54:38,550 --> 00:54:41,719
-Come here.
-Aladdin, don't.

494
00:54:46,324 --> 00:54:48,859
You are the coward, Mehmed!

495
00:54:49,060 --> 00:54:51,595
Is this how your return the helping hand?

496
00:54:51,730 --> 00:54:55,265
You sold us out to the heathens.
You disgraced your sister!

497
00:54:55,600 --> 00:54:58,902
-Alaaddin, stop.
-You deserved that, Alaaddin.

498
00:54:59,137 --> 00:55:02,940
You deserved it!
-Well...

499
00:55:03,441 --> 00:55:08,212
-Brother!
-This is the end, Mehmed.

500
00:55:08,980 --> 00:55:12,015
I told myself to stop for Gonca's sake.

501
00:55:12,083 --> 00:55:17,421
-Please stop this.
-But you never stopped and cooled down.

502
00:55:17,622 --> 00:55:20,290
I won't stop either now. I won't stop!

503
00:55:21,860 --> 00:55:26,163
Please stop!
Please don't do this.

504
00:55:27,999 --> 00:55:30,968
Alaaddin!

505
00:55:39,377 --> 00:55:44,181
You started this war.
You've come here to kill me...

506
00:55:44,349 --> 00:55:48,685
...but I will take your life, Alaaddin.
And I'll take my sister away.

507
00:56:07,872 --> 00:56:12,509
Gonca will stay with her husband. But...

508
00:56:14,813 --> 00:56:18,749
-You're going into the grave.
-Alaaddin.

509
00:56:26,391 --> 00:56:28,992
Alaaddin!

510
00:56:37,268 --> 00:56:41,538
Gonca? Gonca! Let's go, my dear.

511
00:56:55,653 --> 00:56:58,922
Gokmen! Gokmen!

512
00:56:59,190 --> 00:57:03,227
Gonca! What did you do Gonca!

513
00:57:17,742 --> 00:57:21,812
Gonca! I did everything for my State!

514
00:57:21,946 --> 00:57:26,917
The day will come when I will take
back my sister and our lands from you!

515
00:57:27,085 --> 00:57:30,120
I will ease the pain of my father!

516
00:57:43,735 --> 00:57:46,036
Gonca!

517
00:57:46,104 --> 00:57:47,854
My Gonca, are you alright?

518
00:57:47,866 --> 00:57:50,607
Alaeddin, he was
not the brother I knew.

519
00:57:51,009 --> 00:57:54,678
He sold us. Alaeddin he sold us to the infidels!

520
00:57:54,913 --> 00:57:57,247
-Stay calm.
-I have no one left!

521
00:57:57,315 --> 00:58:00,951
Alaeddin I have no one
left! I don't have a family!

522
00:58:01,052 --> 00:58:03,253
-I have no one! -That's not true.

523
00:58:03,621 --> 00:58:07,090
You have me. Don't worry.

524
00:58:07,225 --> 00:58:09,927
Don't worry, Gonca.

525
00:58:14,699 --> 00:58:19,803
Alaeddin. What did you do, brother?

526
00:58:29,147 --> 00:58:33,083
-Be cautious.
-As you command, my Shahzade.

527
00:59:17,362 --> 00:59:20,664
-Orhan?
-Holofira.

528
00:59:31,943 --> 00:59:34,444
The fate of this wound..

529
00:59:35,780 --> 00:59:39,149
..is to always bleed it seems, Lord's Daughter.

530
00:59:56,234 --> 00:59:59,436
Thank you.

531
01:00:00,671 --> 01:00:02,939
Is Osman Bey alright?

532
01:00:03,007 --> 01:00:05,509
Konstantin set him up.

533
01:00:05,643 --> 01:00:09,646
My father got out alive from that dog's trap.

534
01:00:09,781 --> 01:00:11,648
However, Konstantin..

535
01:00:12,016 --> 01:00:15,786
..Konstantin understood the
wrath of Osman Bey, Holofira.

536
01:00:16,921 --> 01:00:19,256
-What do you mean?
-Holofira.

537
01:00:19,357 --> 01:00:22,159
We've avenged your father,
and all those oppressed people.

538
01:00:22,160 --> 01:00:22,959
Weâ€™ve avenged your father,
and all those oppressed people.

539
01:00:23,061 --> 01:00:26,196
Konstantin is dead.

540
01:00:49,253 --> 01:00:53,790
You didn't need to come. You
could've sent word with alps.

541
01:00:54,192 --> 01:00:57,327
We did our duty, Holofira.

542
01:00:57,662 --> 01:01:02,165
I came to take you away from here.

543
01:01:03,568 --> 01:01:06,603
Take me away? To where?

544
01:01:06,704 --> 01:01:09,873
My father wanted you to be somewhere safer.

545
01:01:09,974 --> 01:01:12,242
If you do not want to stay in our tribe..

546
01:01:12,310 --> 01:01:16,246
..we can settle you in one of the cities.

547
01:01:18,082 --> 01:01:22,486
Everyone who knew my
connection with you is dead.

548
01:01:24,188 --> 01:01:28,158
I am safe now, Orhan Bey.

549
01:01:28,759 --> 01:01:32,129
My duties here hasn't ended as well.

550
01:01:35,266 --> 01:01:38,335
Konstantin may be dead, however, his father..

551
01:01:40,538 --> 01:01:44,508
..my uncle is still alive.
I will track him down.

552
01:01:44,742 --> 01:01:48,645
I will go to Constantinople if needed.

553
01:01:49,881 --> 01:01:54,818
I will only live for my vengeance from now on.

554
01:01:56,420 --> 01:01:59,623
However, no matter where I am..

555
01:01:59,757 --> 01:02:03,527
..my service to Osman Bey will continue.

556
01:02:06,564 --> 01:02:09,766
Thank you.

557
01:02:10,001 --> 01:02:12,903
If you say so.

558
01:02:13,905 --> 01:02:17,307
Since you don't want to come..

559
01:02:19,710 --> 01:02:23,046
..of course I will not object.

560
01:02:23,948 --> 01:02:27,484
Don't object, Orhan.

561
01:02:27,685 --> 01:02:30,320
Do not.

562
01:02:30,488 --> 01:02:35,926
Remember when you told me
that destiny brought me to you?

563
01:02:36,661 --> 01:02:40,163
The same destiny set us apart.

564
01:02:43,534 --> 01:02:47,337
You will go back to your home..

565
01:02:47,638 --> 01:02:51,141
..to your hatun.

566
01:02:52,243 --> 01:02:54,744
You will be very happy.

567
01:02:54,845 --> 01:02:58,415
And I will be very happy after that.

568
01:03:07,825 --> 01:03:11,394
Your smile..

569
01:03:12,363 --> 01:03:15,865
..may your smile never goes away, Holofira.

570
01:03:16,100 --> 01:03:18,635
Even though I won't see you..

571
01:03:18,803 --> 01:03:21,972
..I hope that you be always happy.

572
01:03:32,383 --> 01:03:35,085
Go now.

573
01:03:38,623 --> 01:03:40,423
Go.

574
01:03:40,725 --> 01:03:43,893
Come on.

575
01:03:44,228 --> 01:03:46,162
Come on.

576
01:03:49,500 --> 01:03:52,302
Come on, go now.

577
01:03:54,639 --> 01:03:57,307
Goodbye.

578
01:05:27,765 --> 01:05:30,500
I am welcomed.

579
01:05:30,701 --> 01:05:34,104
May you live long, Osman Bey!

580
01:05:37,141 --> 01:05:42,412
-My Bey, are you alright?
-I am alright, Bala.

581
01:05:43,347 --> 01:05:49,052
-Father.
-My Fatma, I am alright.

582
01:05:50,721 --> 01:05:55,325
Elcim, we avenged your father.

583
01:05:55,893 --> 01:05:59,963
We sent that dog Konstantin to hell.

584
01:06:11,175 --> 01:06:16,813
-May you prosper.
-May you prosper, Osman Bey. Thank Allah.

585
01:06:17,982 --> 01:06:23,052
However, I can not see Orhan Bey. Is he alright?

586
01:06:23,287 --> 01:06:26,089
He went to Holofira.

587
01:06:26,490 --> 01:06:30,160
As you know, his secret is revealed.

588
01:06:32,363 --> 01:06:36,633
Thanks to him, I was saved from slander.

589
01:06:39,236 --> 01:06:45,442
We took the heads of those who stood against us.

590
01:06:45,943 --> 01:06:50,146
We made infidels bow down with our swords.

591
01:06:50,514 --> 01:06:56,019
We brought their treasures to our tribe.

592
01:06:59,156 --> 01:07:03,326
With Allah's permission victory became ours.

593
01:07:03,427 --> 01:07:05,562
Of course it did.

594
01:07:05,729 --> 01:07:07,797
While we have our Allah..

595
01:07:07,932 --> 01:07:12,101
..they can not oppress us.

596
01:07:12,536 --> 01:07:15,038
Now, we want to use this treasure..

597
01:07:15,840 --> 01:07:20,477
..for the conquest of Bursa. People!

598
01:07:21,212 --> 01:07:24,814
-Do you allow?
-We allow!

599
01:07:24,982 --> 01:07:31,688
-Do you allow?
-We allow, Osman Bey!

600
01:07:31,789 --> 01:07:34,624
Thank you.

601
01:07:34,692 --> 01:07:37,360
From now on, everyone will know..

602
01:07:38,228 --> 01:07:41,196
..that we are just starting our conquests.

603
01:07:41,432 --> 01:07:50,874
Long live Osman Bey!
Long live Osman Bey!

604
01:07:52,810 --> 01:07:57,647
My Bey. Let us tend to your wounds.

605
01:07:58,048 --> 01:08:00,183
I am alright.

606
01:08:54,737 --> 01:08:57,540
Leave me be with my cousin.

607
01:09:19,395 --> 01:09:22,732
May you burn well, Konstantin.

608
01:09:24,734 --> 01:09:26,703
You killed my father..

609
01:09:27,438 --> 01:09:30,206
..for nothing.

610
01:09:30,274 --> 01:09:32,175
You sent him to death..

611
01:09:32,810 --> 01:09:35,612
..while he was innocent.

612
01:09:36,580 --> 01:09:40,283
And your book is closed now.

613
01:09:40,551 --> 01:09:43,252
Now, it is time..

614
01:09:43,453 --> 01:09:45,955
..for your father.

615
01:09:46,890 --> 01:09:50,560
I will make you meet in hell.

616
01:09:50,627 --> 01:09:52,362
Just wait.

617
01:10:06,477 --> 01:10:11,080
You scared me this time, my Osman.

618
01:10:11,882 --> 01:10:17,220
May Allah protects you.

619
01:10:18,255 --> 01:10:23,726
Bala. You missed me a lot it seems.

620
01:10:25,262 --> 01:10:28,898
Did I wake you up?

621
01:10:30,401 --> 01:10:34,103
My beautiful.

622
01:10:34,905 --> 01:10:36,639
Tell me.

623
01:10:37,841 --> 01:10:41,644
Why are you watching me sleep?

624
01:10:43,781 --> 01:10:47,283
I was scared, my Osman.

625
01:10:47,651 --> 01:10:50,653
I was very scared.

626
01:10:50,821 --> 01:10:54,323
I couldn't show it, however..

627
01:10:54,658 --> 01:10:58,728
..I had to stand firm.

628
01:11:01,065 --> 01:11:04,000
Just wait.

629
01:11:04,301 --> 01:11:07,670
What scares you, tell me.

630
01:11:07,738 --> 01:11:09,972
My Hatun is not scared of anything easily.

631
01:11:11,141 --> 01:11:14,677
I am not scared of enemies or infidels.

632
01:11:14,778 --> 01:11:17,513
I am afraid of losing you.

633
01:11:17,748 --> 01:11:20,283
Afraid of missing a lot, my Osman.

634
01:11:21,218 --> 01:11:24,087
Come here.

635
01:11:24,855 --> 01:11:27,724
Come here.

636
01:11:27,858 --> 01:11:30,993
Don't be scared.

637
01:11:31,328 --> 01:11:34,297
You are my sunshine.

638
01:11:34,565 --> 01:11:36,933
You light my way.

639
01:11:37,101 --> 01:11:39,836
Your prayers will protect me.

640
01:11:40,104 --> 01:11:42,004
Do not worry.

641
01:11:42,172 --> 01:11:46,476
So that's why you are going to the enemy alone?

642
01:11:47,644 --> 01:11:51,714
I was not alone.

643
01:11:56,954 --> 01:12:00,490
What is this wound?

644
01:12:00,624 --> 01:12:03,659
Look here. While you have so many more.

645
01:12:03,794 --> 01:12:06,796
And you are asking about a scratch?

646
01:12:07,030 --> 01:12:09,866
It's nothing. Happened at the training.

647
01:12:10,000 --> 01:12:14,036
I was not paying attention
as I was busy missing you.

648
01:12:15,572 --> 01:12:18,241
You know what?

649
01:12:18,742 --> 01:12:23,546
Even this little scar...

650
01:12:23,914 --> 01:12:27,049
...disappears in my heart.

651
01:12:29,753 --> 01:12:33,356
Well... When I fight the enemy,

652
01:12:33,557 --> 01:12:36,359
...they think I'm on my own.

653
01:12:36,860 --> 01:12:39,262
But none of them knows.

654
01:12:39,463 --> 01:12:41,230
None of them.

655
01:12:41,298 --> 01:12:45,201
You are... You are in my heart.

656
01:12:45,803 --> 01:12:50,072
I take strength from you,
my family and my dreams.

657
01:12:50,340 --> 01:12:54,043
But none of them knows this. Well...

658
01:13:02,186 --> 01:13:05,188
GERMIYANOGULLARI BEYLIC
KUTAHYA

659
01:13:05,289 --> 01:13:09,559
Osman Bey completely got out of control.

660
01:13:10,394 --> 01:13:12,628
He crossed the line.

661
01:13:13,931 --> 01:13:18,100
The more powerful he became
the more arrogant he got.

662
01:13:19,536 --> 01:13:23,472
Did he take permission from us? No.

663
01:13:24,875 --> 01:13:26,943
Now his presence...

664
01:13:27,144 --> 01:13:30,947
...compromises our power.

665
01:13:32,850 --> 01:13:35,284
Listen to me carefully now.

666
01:13:40,958 --> 01:13:44,827
-Father.
Mehmed... Mehmed

667
01:13:44,995 --> 01:13:47,330
juos Aw

668
01:13:48,232 --> 01:13:50,766
Mehmed, what happened to you?

669
01:13:50,901 --> 01:13:55,071
-Who did this?
-Kayis...

670
01:13:55,873 --> 01:13:58,641
Kayis attempted to kill me, father.

671
01:13:59,376 --> 01:14:02,111
Why did they do that?

672
01:14:03,947 --> 01:14:08,317
They believed a woman's
words and slandered me, father.

673
01:14:09,853 --> 01:14:12,521
They killed Gokmen.

674
01:14:13,023 --> 01:14:15,291
They took Kanyumaz captive.

675
01:14:15,492 --> 01:14:19,896
Who? Which of them?
-Alaaddin.

676
01:14:19,997 --> 01:14:23,132
Alaaddin, father.

677
01:14:24,534 --> 01:14:27,870
Bring the healers!

678
01:14:33,844 --> 01:14:37,146
Now there's blood feud between us.

679
01:14:38,181 --> 01:14:40,416
They killed...

680
01:14:40,884 --> 01:14:43,586
...my warriors and alps.

681
01:14:44,488 --> 01:14:47,189
I know what to do.

682
01:14:48,225 --> 01:14:53,629
Now Osman's land is a place of raid for us!

683
01:14:53,997 --> 01:14:57,133
Prepare the raiders immediately!

684
01:14:57,267 --> 01:15:02,238
We're going to raid Osman's lands!

685
01:15:05,008 --> 01:15:07,576
I will ruin..

686
01:15:07,945 --> 01:15:11,013
...your sleep in the bed

687
01:15:11,748 --> 01:15:14,817
What are you waiting for? Go!

688
01:15:18,255 --> 01:15:22,391
Mehmed, my son... Hang on, son.

689
01:15:22,592 --> 01:15:25,361
Mehmed... Hold on, son.

690
01:15:25,362 --> 01:15:28,364
Healers!

691
01:15:42,312 --> 01:15:45,982
Allah has spoken the truth.

692
01:15:51,355 --> 01:15:54,290
In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate.

693
01:16:22,753 --> 01:16:25,221
My Gonca.

694
01:16:25,522 --> 01:16:27,656
May Allah accept your prayer, my Bey.

695
01:16:27,691 --> 01:16:30,793
Thank you, my hatun. May
Allah be pleased with you.

696
01:16:32,796 --> 01:16:35,831
The milk is now warm. You can drink it.

697
01:16:36,967 --> 01:16:40,069
Are you even mothering me now?

698
01:16:40,737 --> 01:16:44,774
Fine. I'll drink.

699
01:16:58,255 --> 01:17:00,756
Does the wound that my brother opened...

700
01:17:04,461 --> 01:17:06,829
...hurt?

701
01:17:10,000 --> 01:17:13,702
Do not upset yourself, my Hatun.

702
01:17:14,137 --> 01:17:17,073
You are not guilty.

703
01:17:17,374 --> 01:17:19,408
My Gonca.

704
01:17:20,744 --> 01:17:23,546
From now on, it will be even more difficult.

705
01:17:26,316 --> 01:17:29,552
This is called war, my rose.

706
01:17:30,620 --> 01:17:34,356
I want something difficult
from you, I know, but...

707
01:17:35,492 --> 01:17:38,661
..from now on, you should be stronger.

708
01:17:39,729 --> 01:17:42,498
Don't worry, my Bey.

709
01:17:43,100 --> 01:17:45,601
It's over now.

710
01:17:46,369 --> 01:17:50,606
I made sure of it today. From now on...

711
01:17:53,110 --> 01:17:56,645
...there will be only us.

712
01:18:10,026 --> 01:18:14,563
When will we organize our wedding, Coy Hatun?

713
01:18:17,367 --> 01:18:20,402
The weather is nice as well.

714
01:18:20,604 --> 01:18:23,539
What should we do? Should we hold our wedding?

715
01:18:25,108 --> 01:18:27,042
If you tell me no again..

716
01:18:27,344 --> 01:18:31,614
...we will be the first ones to hold a
wedding with their baby in Kayi tribe.

717
01:18:31,681 --> 01:18:36,018
No... We can't do that, right? We can't.

718
01:18:37,521 --> 01:18:40,222
What should we do?

719
01:18:41,057 --> 01:18:44,226
Let's just do it, huh? But...

720
01:18:44,394 --> 01:18:46,962
...so that we've waited this long...

721
01:18:47,030 --> 01:18:49,820
...I am expecting a legendary
wedding, Alaeddin Bey.

722
01:18:49,832 --> 01:18:50,766
Allah Allah..

723
01:18:50,901 --> 01:18:52,334
You Trickster Hatun...

724
01:18:52,335 --> 01:18:54,685
I would never say no if you
asked for a beautiful wedding.

725
01:18:54,697 --> 01:18:55,838
That is your duty, Alaeddin.

726
01:18:55,839 --> 01:18:57,573
I said what I needed to say.

727
01:19:00,243 --> 01:19:02,011
Then...

728
01:19:02,145 --> 01:19:05,481
...I will organize a glorious wedding for you.

729
01:19:05,582 --> 01:19:07,016
Good.

730
01:19:11,388 --> 01:19:17,159
My baby... I and your
mother will have a wedding.

731
01:19:25,936 --> 01:19:30,839
Osman Bey... I am writing this letter
to inform you about a great danger.

732
01:19:31,041 --> 01:19:34,510
You avenged my father and the oppressed.

733
01:19:34,711 --> 01:19:38,581
Constantine got lost, but...

734
01:19:38,648 --> 01:19:42,985
...this made Emperor
Andronikos even more furious.

735
01:19:43,053 --> 01:19:46,388
I found out that he will
send a new Lord to Bursa.

736
01:19:46,790 --> 01:19:50,459
I know the Lord that will come here.

737
01:19:50,961 --> 01:19:54,863
Constantine's father, my uncle...

738
01:19:55,565 --> 01:19:59,235
...Justinianus Paleologos.

739
01:20:00,036 --> 01:20:02,071
He is a ruthless and vile man...

740
01:20:02,272 --> 01:20:04,607
...who killed his own brother...

741
01:20:04,808 --> 01:20:08,143
...my father. He is coming
to protect Bursa and...

742
01:20:08,378 --> 01:20:12,181
...and to take his revenge from you.

743
01:20:24,261 --> 01:20:28,897
Thanks to Allah. Thank you, Hatun.

744
01:20:31,401 --> 01:20:36,772
Did you... believe that I exposed Holofira?

745
01:20:45,982 --> 01:20:51,120
I won't lie to you, Hatun.
I was suspicious at the beginning.

746
01:20:52,188 --> 01:20:56,225
But even then, I remembered how...

747
01:20:56,459 --> 01:20:58,761
...brave and glorious Hatun you were...

748
01:20:59,162 --> 01:21:03,932
...and that you only lived for
our Beylics, not for yourself.

749
01:21:04,200 --> 01:21:07,970
Then I said "Elcim Hatun would never do this."

750
01:21:08,238 --> 01:21:10,539
"My Hatun would never do this.", I said.

751
01:21:11,308 --> 01:21:15,678
Thanks to Allah. My innocence is proven...

752
01:21:16,279 --> 01:21:20,749
How is Holofira? You are
the last person who saw her...

753
01:21:21,217 --> 01:21:25,120
Elcim...
I am not complaining.

754
01:21:25,422 --> 01:21:28,624
You did well by
saying goodbye to her.

755
01:21:28,692 --> 01:21:31,026
I owe Holofira again.

756
01:21:31,161 --> 01:21:34,496
Thanks to her, my innocence was
proven. That's why I am curious.

757
01:21:34,698 --> 01:21:37,399
Is she alright? -She is.

758
01:21:37,901 --> 01:21:41,770
She will now live in the
monastery. That's what she decided.

759
01:21:44,441 --> 01:21:47,276
Now we left everything in the past.

760
01:21:47,377 --> 01:21:50,346
Everyone will live their own lives.

761
01:21:51,114 --> 01:21:54,116
But those left behind...

762
01:21:54,551 --> 01:21:57,152
My father now rests in peace.

763
01:21:57,420 --> 01:22:01,290
Thanks to you, my Bey. Thanks to all of you.

764
01:22:02,225 --> 01:22:05,527
You took my father's revenge.

765
01:22:05,762 --> 01:22:09,765
I promised you, Hatun. Thanks to my Allah...

766
01:22:10,066 --> 01:22:12,801
...He granted me with keeping my promise.

767
01:22:13,002 --> 01:22:15,904
It is my duty to make the pain that...

768
01:22:16,139 --> 01:22:18,374
...hurts your heart disappear.

769
01:22:18,742 --> 01:22:21,310
Because you and I..

770
01:22:21,411 --> 01:22:24,813
We are family, Elcim.

771
01:22:26,449 --> 01:22:31,453
Even if it's just the two of
us for now, we are family.

772
01:22:47,203 --> 01:22:51,306
It's not just the two of us now, Orhan Bey.

773
01:22:55,345 --> 01:22:58,347
Elcim?

774
01:23:03,686 --> 01:23:05,587
I am pregnant, my Bey.

775
01:23:07,524 --> 01:23:10,826
You are going to be a father.

776
01:23:11,094 --> 01:23:12,712
What are you saying, Hatun?

777
01:23:12,724 --> 01:23:14,596
You are going to be a father.

778
01:23:14,831 --> 01:23:18,100
This is such blessed news!

779
01:23:18,301 --> 01:23:20,636
Thanks to Allah!

780
01:23:22,105 --> 01:23:25,107
Thanks to Allah, Elcim.

781
01:23:25,241 --> 01:23:28,877
You made me so happy...

782
01:23:46,763 --> 01:23:51,133
Attention! Osman Bey!

783
01:24:06,382 --> 01:24:09,318
We are ready, my Bey.

784
01:24:11,354 --> 01:24:14,556
You may sit.

785
01:24:25,335 --> 01:24:28,403
I am...

786
01:24:29,672 --> 01:24:35,077
...the owner of all lands at the frontiers...

787
01:24:40,917 --> 01:24:44,119
...the protector of Turks...

788
01:24:45,221 --> 01:24:50,759
...the guardian of Islam..

789
01:24:54,230 --> 01:24:57,499
..and the servant of Allah..

790
01:24:59,569 --> 01:25:01,386
...Osman Bey.

791
01:25:02,696 --> 01:25:04,006
GERMIYANOGULLARI BEYLIC
KUTAHYA

792
01:25:04,007 --> 01:25:06,675
I am the one who has
grown my Beylic every day...

793
01:25:06,809 --> 01:25:11,179
...which was attempted
to be destroyed by fitna...

794
01:25:11,180 --> 01:25:12,581
...into a state.

795
01:25:13,483 --> 01:25:18,921
I have made Iznik kneel. I have
made commanders bow down.

796
01:25:19,489 --> 01:25:21,857
What I expect...

797
01:25:22,125 --> 01:25:30,232
...from the man who receives this letter is
to recognize the state I have established.

798
01:25:33,736 --> 01:25:38,907
Otherwise, within the borders of
my lands, he will not be recognized...

799
01:25:39,075 --> 01:25:43,445
...and his all properties
will be destroyed. Whoever...

800
01:25:43,513 --> 01:25:47,849
...opposes the blessed state of the Turks...

801
01:25:47,951 --> 01:25:53,355
...may they express their opposition
not with a letter but on the battlefield.

802
01:25:53,623 --> 01:26:01,330
May they stand before us. May
the blessings of Allah be upon you.

803
01:26:20,483 --> 01:26:25,520
Those letters will be sent everywhere!

804
01:26:25,722 --> 01:26:32,661
First, it will be sent to Emperor
Andronikos in Constantinople.

805
01:26:33,796 --> 01:26:38,133
It will be sent to Yakup
Bey in Kutahya, Candar...

806
01:26:38,401 --> 01:26:42,738
...Karesi Beylics, Kinez' in north...

807
01:26:42,839 --> 01:26:46,975
..Badawis in south.

808
01:26:49,912 --> 01:26:53,515
They will be sent everywhere.

809
01:26:55,918 --> 01:27:01,757
And they will all recognize...

810
01:27:02,392 --> 01:27:05,127
..our state.

811
01:27:19,509 --> 01:27:22,611
Here.

812
01:27:29,318 --> 01:27:32,754
The messengers can set out.

813
01:27:41,497 --> 01:27:44,800
Here.

814
01:28:00,116 --> 01:28:03,251
Orhan Bey.

815
01:28:03,386 --> 01:28:07,522
-Did you send the messengers for scholars?
-Yes my Bey.

816
01:28:07,790 --> 01:28:11,693
We sent messengers everywhere
and invited them all to our lands.

817
01:28:11,728 --> 01:28:15,464
We told them that we will do everything
necessary to benefit from their knowledge.

818
01:28:15,465 --> 01:28:19,568
Thank you, thank you. We will use
all of our opportunities for them.

819
01:28:19,602 --> 01:28:22,637
Our land will be the homeland
of knowledge and wisdom.

820
01:28:22,805 --> 01:28:26,708
-I hope so, my Bey.
-Can I come in, my Bey?

821
01:28:27,176 --> 01:28:31,379
Come in, Samil.

822
01:28:31,814 --> 01:28:35,650
My Bey, we sent Alps everywhere in west.

823
01:28:35,651 --> 01:28:39,588
Alps communicate with each other
from a distance with burning arrows.

824
01:28:39,622 --> 01:28:43,024
If they attack, they will
all go there and fight back.

825
01:28:43,192 --> 01:28:46,895
Everywhere in our lands is safe, my Bey.

826
01:28:47,597 --> 01:28:50,332
We should not worry about this.

827
01:28:50,633 --> 01:28:55,937
Our enemies must worry about this.

828
01:29:01,477 --> 01:29:05,580
Now... we will organize our wedding.

829
01:29:08,551 --> 01:29:09,351
Come on.

830
01:30:30,066 --> 01:30:33,134
My Bala... I told you that you
couldn't ride faster than me.

831
01:30:33,669 --> 01:30:37,305
What is that, my Osman? You speak as if you won.

832
01:30:37,506 --> 01:30:40,542
e came here at the same time.
-That's why I am surprised.

833
01:30:40,543 --> 01:30:43,378
You became a grandmother,
but you can still compete with me.

834
01:30:43,379 --> 01:30:45,380
Why would you say that?

835
01:30:45,481 --> 01:30:48,283
Alright, alright. That was a joke.

836
01:31:08,571 --> 01:31:11,239
So... the seeds we planted...

837
01:31:11,407 --> 01:31:14,809
...they all turned green and bear fruit now.

838
01:31:14,977 --> 01:31:19,481
-I cannot describe how happy I am.
-I am also so happy, my Osman.

839
01:31:19,982 --> 01:31:24,252
The things we dreamt of in the
past are now becoming true, huh?

840
01:31:24,287 --> 01:31:27,188
Right... right. We are
going to have grandchildren.

841
01:31:27,290 --> 01:31:30,025
Our family is growing, our lands are expanding.

842
01:31:30,026 --> 01:31:32,594
Like the roots of this mighty sycamore...

843
01:31:32,695 --> 01:31:35,263
...our state will also be strong.

844
01:31:35,364 --> 01:31:39,067
Thanks to your faith and strength, my Osman.

845
01:31:39,201 --> 01:31:41,269
You are the root of this state.

846
01:31:41,504 --> 01:31:45,540
The stronger the roots,
the stronger the body, right?

847
01:31:45,942 --> 01:31:48,777
Our children are following your path too.

848
01:31:51,747 --> 01:31:54,616
All of us. My Bala.

849
01:31:54,717 --> 01:31:57,585
If I am the roots of this mighty sycamore...

850
01:31:57,853 --> 01:32:01,990
...you are the soil from which those roots grow.

851
01:32:02,458 --> 01:32:05,560
I draw my strength from this soil.

852
01:32:05,661 --> 01:32:10,899
You nurture us with your compassion and mercy.

853
01:32:11,934 --> 01:32:16,738
I have given my life and
heart to this dream, my Osman.

854
01:32:16,806 --> 01:32:19,441
Your path is my path.

855
01:32:20,142 --> 01:32:24,813
I know. I know. How will I ever repay you? How?

856
01:32:24,914 --> 01:32:27,949
You have shed...

857
01:32:28,050 --> 01:32:32,354
...many tears, blood, and sweat for this da'wah.

858
01:32:33,589 --> 01:32:37,359
You... you are my companion on this path.

859
01:32:37,426 --> 01:32:41,363
The mother of my children and...

860
01:32:41,430 --> 01:32:46,368
...the Sultan of my heart.
-Is that so?

861
01:32:51,173 --> 01:32:56,077
So where do we go now, Osman Bey?
-Our way...

862
01:32:57,546 --> 01:33:01,383
...is the way to the state.

863
01:33:23,305 --> 01:33:25,206
What...

864
01:33:25,207 --> 01:33:27,342
Give me strength, Allah...

865
01:33:30,312 --> 01:33:33,848
Mother.. It smells amazing.

866
01:33:34,016 --> 01:33:36,151
It is Toyga soup.

867
01:33:36,318 --> 01:33:41,156
If someone sees your face, they will think
I am starving you. Why are you drooling?

868
01:33:41,490 --> 01:33:44,659
Go! Go! You are just like your father.

869
01:34:06,015 --> 01:34:08,783
Ghazi Alp. This is Herise.

870
01:34:08,851 --> 01:34:11,419
Taste it.

871
01:34:12,288 --> 01:34:16,591
It looks really good. Allah Allah...

872
01:34:18,961 --> 01:34:23,865
Huseyin Agha... where did you come from?

873
01:34:29,538 --> 01:34:34,476
I came from Sogut, my
valiant. I am the cook of Sogut.

874
01:34:36,946 --> 01:34:40,791
When the lamb is cooked,
we can say the meal is ready.

875
01:34:40,803 --> 01:34:42,250
Praise be, master.

876
01:34:49,592 --> 01:34:53,895
Praise be. These necks must be delicious.

877
01:34:55,965 --> 01:34:59,934
Mother... Don't
get jealous, but...

878
01:35:00,102 --> 01:35:04,038
..he cooks better than you

879
01:35:13,249 --> 01:35:16,618
Don't act like you never ate that thing!

880
01:35:21,490 --> 01:35:24,292
O, people!

881
01:35:24,426 --> 01:35:26,461
The steppe is awakening..

882
01:35:26,629 --> 01:35:30,498
...those who are brave shoulder
the burdens. The brave lead the way...

883
01:35:30,766 --> 01:35:33,902
...the elders follow from behind.

884
01:35:34,136 --> 01:35:38,439
Clear the path! The hennaed goats...

885
01:35:38,541 --> 01:35:42,510
...are coming on shoulders!
-May men be tested...

886
01:35:42,611 --> 01:35:45,680
...may valiants show their talents! Come on now!

887
01:35:45,714 --> 01:35:47,949
Let's see who is the fastest in the tribe!

888
01:35:47,950 --> 01:35:50,818
My Bey is talking about me,
brother. Give up while you still can.

889
01:35:50,986 --> 01:35:53,788
This time I won't let you pass me.
-We'll see who will pass...

890
01:35:53,989 --> 01:35:57,926
...and who will win, Alaeddin.
-Let's go, brother.

891
01:35:58,060 --> 01:36:01,529
Come on, take the goats.
-Let's go.

892
01:36:03,766 --> 01:36:09,237
-In the name of Allah.
-In the name of Allah.

893
01:36:11,507 --> 01:36:14,309
Cerkutay! -My Bey!
-Shoot the arrow!

894
01:36:14,877 --> 01:36:19,280
Yes my Bey. In the name of Allah.

895
01:36:29,325 --> 01:36:33,561
-Start!
-Come on!

896
01:36:39,001 --> 01:36:41,869
Come on!

897
01:36:43,939 --> 01:36:46,507
Orhan!

898
01:36:56,919 --> 01:37:00,321
No! Come on, no stopping!

899
01:37:00,422 --> 01:37:04,792
Come on! In the name of Allah.

900
01:37:06,929 --> 01:37:12,000
You used to race while I wait back then,
now our sons race and the hatuns wait.

901
01:37:12,268 --> 01:37:16,037
Our sons got married
and brought joy to our tribe.

902
01:37:16,305 --> 01:37:18,806
They did.

903
01:37:23,445 --> 01:37:26,447
Come on valiants!

904
01:37:27,983 --> 01:37:31,552
Come on, my Bey!

905
01:37:57,446 --> 01:38:00,315
Praise be, praise be!

906
01:38:03,252 --> 01:38:05,386
So, Hatun.

907
01:38:05,454 --> 01:38:07,155
Now there is no doubt..

908
01:38:07,156 --> 01:38:10,725
..that your valiant is the
fastest in the tribe, right brother?

909
01:38:11,493 --> 01:38:13,761
You think you got past me now.

910
01:38:13,862 --> 01:38:17,098
I let you take the lead. Or, you know..

911
01:38:17,399 --> 01:38:21,969
..you can't beat me if I had two lambs on me.

912
01:38:22,438 --> 01:38:25,173
-So you say so.
-Yes.

913
01:38:25,341 --> 01:38:28,710
Look, Gonca Hatun is saying something.

914
01:38:34,316 --> 01:38:37,819
Run, Orhan Bey!

915
01:38:40,122 --> 01:38:42,890
They are still kids, Bala.

916
01:38:43,092 --> 01:38:48,730
They are. They never grow old.

917
01:38:51,200 --> 01:38:54,402
People!

918
01:38:54,603 --> 01:38:57,739
There will be a feast!

919
01:38:57,873 --> 01:39:02,210
Today is the happiest day
of the tribe! Come on valiants!

920
01:39:02,311 --> 01:39:06,981
Long live Osman Bey!
Long live Osman Bey!

921
01:39:36,912 --> 01:39:41,482
Mother, look at this wattle!

922
01:39:49,691 --> 01:39:54,629
Look at this, praise be!

923
01:39:56,231 --> 01:40:00,902
-Look here!
-I see it!

924
01:40:02,771 --> 01:40:06,174
Praise be, cook!

925
01:40:08,110 --> 01:40:13,581
Mother, what were you feeding me all this time?

926
01:40:13,649 --> 01:40:17,084
Gazi, from now on..

927
01:40:17,953 --> 01:40:21,989
-..you will eat the ladle!
-Stop, mother!

928
01:40:56,825 --> 01:41:00,461
Praise be, Master Huseyin.

929
01:41:00,963 --> 01:41:02,997
You let your craft speak again.

930
01:41:03,065 --> 01:41:06,300
May you prosper.

931
01:41:06,502 --> 01:41:09,804
Enjoy, my Bey.

932
01:41:09,872 --> 01:41:12,573
Thank you.

933
01:41:13,442 --> 01:41:15,343
In the name of Allah.

934
01:41:19,348 --> 01:41:23,417
Praise be. It is delicious.

935
01:41:31,026 --> 01:41:35,396
Time goes on.

936
01:41:35,464 --> 01:41:38,165
-Come on now, Boran.
-My Bey.

937
01:41:38,333 --> 01:41:40,768
Play your qopuz...

938
01:41:41,003 --> 01:41:43,938
..in this joyful day.

939
01:41:44,006 --> 01:41:46,774
Sure, my Bey.

940
01:42:07,963 --> 01:42:10,998
Alps shall equip weapon.

941
01:42:11,033 --> 01:42:14,201
The flag shall rise up to the sky.

942
01:42:14,202 --> 01:42:17,171
The dress shall be stained with blood.

943
01:42:17,172 --> 01:42:20,141
Bursa is in our heart.

944
01:42:20,142 --> 01:42:23,077
The dress shall be stained with blood.

