980
01:44:34,443 --> 01:44:38,713
-Well sung, Boran.
-Thank you, my Bey.

981
01:44:39,214 --> 01:44:42,049
We have Bursa in our hearts...

982
01:44:53,428 --> 01:44:56,130
Elcim.

983
01:45:01,369 --> 01:45:04,371
I'm sorry for what happened.

984
01:45:05,040 --> 01:45:09,276
We almost blamed you because of my brother.

985
01:45:11,513 --> 01:45:14,648
It's not your fault, Gonca.

986
01:45:15,250 --> 01:45:19,153
You forgive me.

987
01:45:20,288 --> 01:45:24,425
I broke your heart, said bad things.

988
01:45:25,560 --> 01:45:28,028
It's not a problem anymore.

989
01:45:29,397 --> 01:45:32,266
It's just gone.

990
01:45:39,207 --> 01:45:41,275
Praise be.

991
01:45:41,476 --> 01:45:45,045
Praise be to my beautiful girls.

992
01:45:46,448 --> 01:45:48,749
This is what being a family means.

993
01:45:49,084 --> 01:45:53,187
Sometimes we get cross but we also make peace.

994
01:45:53,588 --> 01:45:57,892
-May Allah not ruin our peace and order.
-I hope so.

995
01:45:59,961 --> 01:46:03,197
I hope so, mother.

996
01:46:04,132 --> 01:46:06,133
Nobody...

997
01:46:06,902 --> 01:46:10,871
Nobody can pick the house they are born into.

998
01:46:11,439 --> 01:46:14,375
But we can pick our family.

999
01:46:14,709 --> 01:46:18,813
Of course we can, my beautiful girl.

1000
01:46:19,447 --> 01:46:22,817
-You're so beautiful.
-Thanks.

1001
01:46:22,918 --> 01:46:26,754
Yes, praise be!

1002
01:46:28,890 --> 01:46:32,426
I don't have any other families but you.

1003
01:46:38,733 --> 01:46:42,169
Here is the henna.

1004
01:46:43,572 --> 01:46:45,773
Mother.

1005
01:46:46,575 --> 01:46:48,809
Take a seat.

1006
01:46:49,010 --> 01:46:52,246
-Is this a joke? -Come on.

1007
01:46:52,280 --> 01:46:57,451
Well... I think... Everything must be complete.

1008
01:46:57,519 --> 01:46:59,720
There must be henna before the wedding.

1009
01:46:59,721 --> 01:47:03,290
Well... I'm the bride side today.

1010
01:47:03,692 --> 01:47:06,861
Prepare the gold, girl.

1011
01:47:09,664 --> 01:47:13,934
-I've prepared everything.
-Fine. Fine.

1012
01:47:14,369 --> 01:47:18,939
Bring it. In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate.

1013
01:47:25,447 --> 01:47:28,649
Well... The bride isn't opening her hand.

1014
01:47:32,621 --> 01:47:36,190
Fatma, be a good sister-in-law.

1015
01:47:55,911 --> 01:47:59,046
In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate.

1016
01:47:59,347 --> 01:48:03,717
In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate. Praise be!

1017
01:48:10,392 --> 01:48:13,560
Give it to me, girl.

1018
01:48:20,502 --> 01:48:25,039
-Congratulations.
-Thanks.

1019
01:48:26,841 --> 01:48:31,545
Come on! Let's apply henna.

1020
01:48:32,414 --> 01:48:37,284
Praise be to the bride.

1021
01:48:45,327 --> 01:48:48,929
Look at the bride!

1022
01:48:49,130 --> 01:48:52,566
Her hands have henna!

1023
01:48:52,667 --> 01:48:59,640
Don't say anything bad to
her or she'll go back home.

1024
01:48:59,841 --> 01:49:03,444
Her door is hennaed.

1025
01:49:03,578 --> 01:49:06,981
She has the nature of an angel.

1026
01:49:07,082 --> 01:49:10,985
May your henna be blessed, bride.

1027
01:49:11,186 --> 01:49:14,955
May your tent be sweet.

1028
01:49:15,123 --> 01:49:22,162
Look at the bride! Her hands have henna!

1029
01:49:22,263 --> 01:49:29,570
Don't say anything bad to
her or she'll go back home.

1030
01:49:29,704 --> 01:49:32,973
Her door is hennaed.

1031
01:49:33,108 --> 01:49:36,543
She has the nature of an angel.

1032
01:49:36,845 --> 01:49:40,447
May your henna be blessed, bride.

1033
01:49:40,648 --> 01:49:46,120
May your tent be sweet.

1034
01:49:46,888 --> 01:49:49,890
GERMIYANOGULLARl BEYLIC
KUTAHYA

1035
01:49:56,498 --> 01:49:59,299
You took my daughter from me.

1036
01:49:59,901 --> 01:50:05,439
You killed my warriors and alps.

1037
01:50:07,442 --> 01:50:10,511
You did this to my son.

1038
01:50:14,315 --> 01:50:19,219
And now you've even sent me a letter...

1039
01:50:19,587 --> 01:50:23,123
...saying you have become a state?

1040
01:50:26,394 --> 01:50:30,264
Now I have nothing else
but my wrath like this fire...

1041
01:50:30,765 --> 01:50:34,935
...to give you, Osman.

1042
01:50:45,580 --> 01:50:48,215
The door cannot be opened, Tall Shahzade.

1043
01:50:49,918 --> 01:50:51,418
You say it can't?

1044
01:50:52,587 --> 01:50:56,056
-Ghazi... Come on, boy.
-No! No!

1045
01:50:56,057 --> 01:50:58,025
-Come on. Hey, what are you doing?

1046
01:50:58,026 --> 01:51:00,661
This is between Tall Shahzade and me!

1047
01:51:00,795 --> 01:51:03,997
-Stay out of this.
-Cerkutay, stop.

1048
01:51:04,065 --> 01:51:07,401
Ulgen Hatun, Ghazi Alp is right.

1049
01:51:07,602 --> 01:51:11,472
Brother, you should open the
pouch before the door is opened.

1050
01:51:12,407 --> 01:51:15,109
Ghazi...

1051
01:51:16,344 --> 01:51:19,379
You know how it works.

1052
01:51:26,588 --> 01:51:28,522
Here.

1053
01:51:29,357 --> 01:51:34,094
Wow! You pay only this much for Gonca Hatun?

1054
01:51:38,366 --> 01:51:41,335
Fine, take this.

1055
01:51:42,303 --> 01:51:45,105
Gonca Hatun is mine. And
the coins are yours, huh?

1056
01:51:45,173 --> 01:51:46,907
You need to pay more, my Shahzade!

1057
01:51:47,041 --> 01:51:50,310
-Hey, stop this!
-Leave me.

1058
01:51:50,411 --> 01:51:52,112
-My Allah!
-Leave me!

1059
01:51:52,213 --> 01:51:56,116
-Who do you take after? Your mother?
-Leave me!

1060
01:52:09,864 --> 01:52:12,699
My Gonca.

1061
01:52:15,270 --> 01:52:18,438
Well... Congratulations.

1062
01:52:23,978 --> 01:52:25,913
Here we go.

1063
01:53:30,378 --> 01:53:34,248
Praise be, praise be, praise be!

1064
01:53:43,424 --> 01:53:49,329
We thank Allah for letting us see this day.

1065
01:54:00,141 --> 01:54:02,643
Son.

1066
01:54:03,411 --> 01:54:06,446
May Allah give you a good fortune.

1067
01:54:07,015 --> 01:54:10,717
May Allah never let you have a defeat.

1068
01:54:10,752 --> 01:54:14,388
-Aameen!
-Thank you, my Bey.

1069
01:54:23,631 --> 01:54:25,699
Now you aren't a stranger...

1070
01:54:25,767 --> 01:54:28,669
...but a daughter to us, Gonca.

1071
01:54:28,903 --> 01:54:32,105
Feel at home here.

1072
01:54:34,942 --> 01:54:38,111
May Allah give you a long life, mother.

1073
01:54:41,416 --> 01:54:42,783
Well...

1074
01:54:42,884 --> 01:54:49,089
May Allah give you strength and peace at home.

1075
01:54:50,391 --> 01:54:53,282
May Allah give you
children you'll be proud of.

1076
01:54:53,294 --> 01:54:54,261
Aameen!

1077
01:54:54,462 --> 01:54:57,130
Amen, my Bey.

1078
01:54:58,900 --> 01:55:04,571
-My girl, congratulations.
-Thanks, Osman Bey.

1079
01:55:20,855 --> 01:55:23,924
My brother, may it be blessed.

1080
01:55:24,025 --> 01:55:27,461
Thank you, brother.

1081
01:55:31,733 --> 01:55:36,169
My Bey, with your permission,

1082
01:55:36,537 --> 01:55:40,741
...we'd like to give great news on such a day.

1083
01:55:43,544 --> 01:55:45,245
What is it?

1084
01:55:45,580 --> 01:55:49,516
If Allah permits, from now on, we'll
be more in numbers for our cause.

1085
01:55:49,851 --> 01:55:54,988
I'll have a baby to carry our
flag and swing a sword!

1086
01:55:55,556 --> 01:55:58,992
Praise be! Praise be!

1087
01:55:59,060 --> 01:56:01,428
If it's a boy, my Bey, with Allah's will

1088
01:56:01,429 --> 01:56:05,132
...we'll name him after his
grandfather Suleyman Shah.

1089
01:56:05,199 --> 01:56:09,169
-Praise be!
-Praise be.

1090
01:56:09,737 --> 01:56:12,939
On such a happy day you are giving me...

1091
01:56:13,341 --> 01:56:16,042
...the great news of two grandchildren, huh?

1092
01:56:16,110 --> 01:56:18,678
Let me kiss your hand, my Bey.

1093
01:56:22,884 --> 01:56:27,020
-Thank you, son.
-Congratulations.

1094
01:56:28,122 --> 01:56:33,160
-My Bey, congratulations.
-Thank you, Osman Bey.

1095
01:56:38,399 --> 01:56:41,668
May Allah give you a healthy baby, my girl.

1096
01:56:41,736 --> 01:56:44,271
-Thank you, mother Bala.
-May Allah give us a child..

1097
01:56:44,272 --> 01:56:46,673
...worthy of our nation and state.

1098
01:56:49,744 --> 01:56:54,147
-May it be blessed, I hope.
-Thank you, brother.

1099
01:57:00,621 --> 01:57:04,458
My Bey, may Allah give you...

1100
01:57:04,492 --> 01:57:07,661
...and your family long lives.

1101
01:57:07,695 --> 01:57:09,996
May Allah let your kin...

1102
01:57:09,997 --> 01:57:12,065
...prevail forever!

1103
01:57:12,200 --> 01:57:14,301
-Aameen!
-So be it!

1104
01:57:14,535 --> 01:57:17,871
Thank you, Solgur Agha. Thank you.

1105
01:57:18,272 --> 01:57:20,841
Well...

1106
01:57:23,544 --> 01:57:28,648
O people! Spread the news all around the world!

1107
01:57:31,185 --> 01:57:36,590
I want to see the valiants whose
hearts beat with us, ready for battle...

1108
01:57:36,791 --> 01:57:41,528
.after Friday prayer, in the unity square.

1109
01:57:41,596 --> 01:57:44,464
Let's show the strength
and might of our state...

1110
01:57:44,565 --> 01:57:46,199
...to everyone.

1111
01:57:46,434 --> 01:57:51,538
If Allah permits, my Bey.
If Allah permits, my Bey. If Allah permits, my Bey.

1112
01:59:19,627 --> 01:59:21,795
What did my Alaeddin Bey do?

1113
01:59:21,862 --> 01:59:25,498
He built a tent in the sky.

1114
01:59:25,733 --> 01:59:28,301
What did he do to..

1115
01:59:28,369 --> 01:59:30,337
...make Gonca Hatun happy?

1116
01:59:30,404 --> 01:59:34,941
He turned a horse into a stallion, a
cow into a camel and a sheep into a ram.

1117
01:59:35,009 --> 01:59:37,944
Did he break hearts? Did he say something bad?

1118
01:59:38,012 --> 01:59:41,781
He neither broke hearts nor said anything bad...

1119
01:59:43,050 --> 01:59:46,252
He married Gonca Hatun!

1120
01:59:46,420 --> 01:59:50,323
Then may Allah let them be happy!

1121
01:59:50,391 --> 01:59:53,960
Aameen!

1122
01:59:59,300 --> 02:00:06,172
May you be happy, may
you grow a family together!

1123
02:00:10,144 --> 02:00:12,612
Don't open your eyes, my Hatun.

1124
02:00:12,913 --> 02:00:16,483
Alaeddin, why did you cover my eyes?

1125
02:00:28,596 --> 02:00:32,899
I said don't open your eyes, Hatun.
-I did not.

1126
02:00:46,714 --> 02:00:50,583
You did not open your eyes, right? -I did not.

1127
02:01:09,904 --> 02:01:13,506
You can open your eyes now.

1128
02:01:26,287 --> 02:01:28,588
Alaeddin...

1129
02:01:28,823 --> 02:01:32,859
Alaeddin what did you do?
-Did you like it?

1130
02:01:33,127 --> 02:01:36,362
It looks beautiful!

1131
02:02:16,470 --> 02:02:20,140
Our love started with a daisy, right my rose?

1132
02:02:36,390 --> 02:02:39,926
I hope that from now on..

1133
02:02:40,394 --> 02:02:42,762
..we will..

1134
02:02:43,030 --> 02:02:47,667
...happily live in peace like
these daisies, right my Hatun?

1135
02:02:56,510 --> 02:02:59,979
With our children, if Allah permits my Bey.

1136
02:03:00,181 --> 02:03:02,215
If Allah permits.

1137
02:03:03,317 --> 02:03:05,318
If Allah permits.

1138
02:03:11,258 --> 02:03:16,563
My Gonca... -My Alaeddin...

1139
02:03:26,040 --> 02:03:32,478
The messenger of Allah
kept walking on his way...

1140
02:03:32,646 --> 02:03:35,281
...since his first revelation to...

1141
02:03:35,382 --> 02:03:38,351
...his farewell sermon.

1142
02:03:38,619 --> 02:03:42,488
And you are following the Sunnah.

1143
02:03:43,624 --> 02:03:46,993
You faced numerous obstacles...

1144
02:03:47,094 --> 02:03:51,464
...but you did not give up. You
confronted enemies in your path...

1145
02:03:51,732 --> 02:03:54,534
..and you defeated them.

1146
02:03:54,635 --> 02:03:59,772
However, know that your
way will be more difficult now.

1147
02:03:59,940 --> 02:04:05,478
As you approach your target, the
number of your enemies will increase.

1148
02:04:06,513 --> 02:04:11,684
It's not the visible ones but the hidden ones...

1149
02:04:13,487 --> 02:04:18,691
That's the actual difficulty, Sultan
of words. And the thing in me...

1150
02:04:19,293 --> 02:04:22,662
Only Allah knows it best.

1151
02:04:24,231 --> 02:04:26,799
When I am about to set out for a war...

1152
02:04:31,071 --> 02:04:33,973
...I sometimes ask myself...

1153
02:04:34,208 --> 02:04:38,278
..."Am I doing this for my nafs or...

1154
02:04:38,512 --> 02:04:44,584
...for the sake of Allah's consent?"

1155
02:04:47,788 --> 02:04:50,657
What does your heart say?

1156
02:05:11,912 --> 02:05:15,815
My inner self remains silent.

1157
02:05:19,520 --> 02:05:25,858
But saying it in front of
you will embarrass me...

1158
02:05:26,126 --> 02:05:30,330
...since it might be seen as arrogance.

1159
02:05:34,601 --> 02:05:38,304
Then tell me.

1160
02:05:40,007 --> 02:05:44,243
-Are you shooting the arrow?
-Never!

1161
02:05:44,645 --> 02:05:47,280
I would never say such a thing.

1162
02:05:47,414 --> 02:05:50,550
How dare I?
I repent. How dare I?!

1163
02:06:03,564 --> 02:06:06,599
"When you shot the arrow...

1164
02:06:09,003 --> 02:06:12,739
...It was not you...

1165
02:06:14,808 --> 02:06:17,610
But He was Allah who shot it."
(Surah Al-Anfal 17)

1166
02:06:26,086 --> 02:06:28,755
My Allah..

1167
02:06:28,889 --> 02:06:33,026
My Allah... My Allah...

1168
02:06:33,961 --> 02:06:39,032
Thanks to You.

1169
02:07:20,140 --> 02:07:25,311
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too.

1170
02:07:25,412 --> 02:07:29,482
When The State of Seljuks fell..

1171
02:07:29,883 --> 02:07:34,287
..Turks did not have a State! So we said..

1172
02:07:34,521 --> 02:07:39,292
..if there is a greater one,
if there is a more fair one..

1173
02:07:39,526 --> 02:07:42,595
..let him come.

1174
02:07:42,696 --> 02:07:47,100
If we do not follow him, we are shameless!

1175
02:07:50,204 --> 02:07:55,374
Time and destiny showed
us that, to become a State..

1176
02:07:55,742 --> 02:07:59,011
..there is no other that
deserves being a State but us!

1177
02:07:59,146 --> 02:08:02,615
Thank Allah!

1178
02:08:02,783 --> 02:08:06,853
I went to a hundred wars!
I got alive from all of them!

1179
02:08:07,287 --> 02:08:10,056
I spent my life on the cause of holy war!

1180
02:08:10,257 --> 02:08:14,560
I witness that there is no other
that deserves being a State but you!

1181
02:08:15,095 --> 02:08:20,933
It's either the State or nothing!
It's either the State or nothing!

1182
02:08:35,883 --> 02:08:39,852
The army of Turks! May you prosper!

1183
02:08:39,953 --> 02:08:44,090
May you prosper!

1184
02:08:45,159 --> 02:08:48,060
The thing that is State..

1185
02:08:48,262 --> 02:08:51,297
..will now be called "Osman".

1186
02:08:56,170 --> 02:09:00,840
My Beys, my alps, my bacis!

1187
02:09:01,108 --> 02:09:06,412
We've sent word to the whole World!

1188
02:09:06,713 --> 02:09:12,318
With Allah's permission,
everyone will recognize our State!

1189
02:09:12,586 --> 02:09:16,222
-We hope so, my Bey!
-However, don't forget!

1190
02:09:16,423 --> 02:09:19,292
State requires unity!

1191
02:09:19,459 --> 02:09:23,496
State does not accept seperation!

1192
02:09:23,564 --> 02:09:27,266
That is why we will be..

1193
02:09:27,801 --> 02:09:33,339
..like an enclosed fist! We
will live under a single banner..

1194
02:09:33,473 --> 02:09:36,409
..for the State of Turks!

1195
02:09:36,543 --> 02:09:39,745
Allah is the greatest!
Allah is the greatest!

1196
02:09:47,120 --> 02:09:50,156
-Orhan Bey!
-Yes, my Bey!

1197
02:09:50,290 --> 02:09:52,725
You will settle in Karacahisar..

1198
02:09:52,826 --> 02:09:55,261
..with my daughter Elcim

1199
02:09:55,329 --> 02:10:00,600
And you will prevent all attacks
coming from Germiyanids.

1200
02:10:00,834 --> 02:10:03,836
From now on, borders..

1201
02:10:04,204 --> 02:10:07,039
..will be under your control.

1202
02:10:19,786 --> 02:10:22,388
Thank you, my Bey.

1203
02:10:22,889 --> 02:10:25,558
-Son.
-Honored to..

1204
02:10:25,993 --> 02:10:28,461
..fulfill this duty, my Bey.

1205
02:10:28,762 --> 02:10:31,831
Come on then.

1206
02:10:38,171 --> 02:10:39,739
-Alaeddin!
-My Beyl

1207
02:10:39,806 --> 02:10:42,675
Our tribe will be under your control..

1208
02:10:42,943 --> 02:10:46,979
..with my daughter Gonca.

1209
02:10:47,447 --> 02:10:51,651
You will take care of our traditions.

1210
02:11:03,130 --> 02:11:05,231
As you command, my Bey.

1211
02:11:20,113 --> 02:11:23,182
And we will not give up..

1212
02:11:23,650 --> 02:11:27,687
..marching towards the
enemy, just like the first days.

1213
02:11:28,055 --> 02:11:32,325
Only Allah knows if we will be victorious.

1214
02:11:32,526 --> 02:11:37,029
Our intentions are not
victory, but the cause itself.

1215
02:11:37,464 --> 02:11:40,466
We will walk!

1216
02:11:40,600 --> 02:11:46,772
So that The Grand State of Turks live forever!

1217
02:11:47,541 --> 02:11:53,779
-Allah is the greatest!
-Allah is the greatest!

1218
02:12:10,030 --> 02:12:13,332
I am Osman Bey.

1219
02:12:13,533 --> 02:12:17,303
I inherited the value from
my father Ertugrul Gazi.

1220
02:12:19,606 --> 02:12:23,209
I've made the whole World hear the cause.

1221
02:12:24,945 --> 02:12:28,280
I made the tribe I got from my father bigger.

1222
02:12:28,382 --> 02:12:34,487
I've established a State that
will be a shadow for Turks forever.

1223
02:12:37,124 --> 02:12:39,859
I've walked my way true.

1224
02:12:40,727 --> 02:12:43,796
I never disobeyed tradiitons.

1225
02:12:44,064 --> 02:12:48,834
I never disobeyed Qur'an.

1226
02:12:50,137 --> 02:12:55,174
I never did what Allah was against.

1227
02:12:56,042 --> 02:12:58,611
My advice to those after me..

1228
02:13:00,580 --> 02:13:04,049
..do not ever leave traditions.

1229
02:13:04,751 --> 02:13:07,553
My sons.

1230
02:13:07,821 --> 02:13:14,093
My alps. My scholars and my people.

1231
02:13:15,495 --> 02:13:20,065
May they never leave justice.

1232
02:13:20,801 --> 02:13:25,638
May you prevail walking the way of Allah.

1233
02:13:26,139 --> 02:13:28,541
So that..

1234
02:13:28,809 --> 02:13:33,446
...you may deserve the
tortures your ancestors endured.

1235
02:13:35,041 --> 02:13:52,331
Visit turkision.com for more!